The following uses or conditions shall be and are hereby prohibited within wellhead protection zones, whether or not such use or condition may otherwise be ordinarily included as a part of a use permitted under this section:
(a) Any new septic tanks or drain fields appurtenant thereto may not be less than 100 feet from the wellhead;
(b) Sanitary landfills;
(c) Hazardous waste disposal sites;
(d) Any new stormwater infiltration basins within 500 feet of the wellhead;
(e) Any new underground storage tanks within 500 feet of the wellhead;
(f) Any new sanitary sewer lines within the control zone of a wellhead.
(Ord. No. 014-08, § 4, 5-13-08)
